        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "[57:4]  He is the One who created the heavens and the earth in six days,* then assumed all authority. He knows everything that enters into the earth, and everything that comes out of it, and everything that descends from the sky, and everything that ascends into it. He is with you wherever you may be. GOD is Seer of everything you do.",
