        },
        {
          "word": " know",
          "start": 2789.13,
          "end": 2789.23,
          "speaker": "A woman and a group of children"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "We know that everywhere our eyes can see, there are God's creation and signs to observe.",
